  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861847-114651791852237200-Jq8sMjzNw_Ja73p0R2S-0l3mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M5ejYui2C4QC53LgqLVArHw\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"详解\">【详解】<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Na </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">0 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价升为 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">+1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价失去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/db60b4bd2556990138580fe492db7a42.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Na </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参与反应失去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7c56a1cb791d15b13b2d45ab61656a35.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选项中电子数目标注错误，应为</span><img  height=\"44\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/19/1a9e99e6-3615-40d7-8d10-8de107d5ea5d.png\" width=\"166\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">错误；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．该反应为归中反应，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1a79458f1fa136c6e2ac992bc52194ed.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">+5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价降为</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2aa6f17a4028889880dd7ee4825fa72a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/387d2029bc8e5f0ceb454be937a07e3f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">-1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价升为 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">0 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价失</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2aa6f17a4028889880dd7ee4825fa72a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，转移电子总数为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2aa6f17a4028889880dd7ee4825fa72a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选项电子数目标注错误，应为</span><img  height=\"75\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/19/8d6565db-f473-4dd3-92fb-cfeb3422209a.png\" width=\"193\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">错误；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．该反应为歧化反应，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/39db0d5f5533066dab682ec1bf4c39bf.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中有</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">原子得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c849b2b2aedd253d1bbdc5e37586d8e8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1bf4d3b85e653149d9254d3edc07549f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，另有</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">原子失</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c849b2b2aedd253d1bbdc5e37586d8e8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b7fd4e26142a3bfe001c2972ea0aed7f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">+1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">价</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0718efffa328c4c677660fa0d6e1a82a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，电子转移表示正确，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">正确；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/38976580545a0405e4847dc13b4d221f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">化合价升高失电子，浓</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/dbc7bcfe5cacce080d9a3d2ccf9366e0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3482b3e788f6069d41ee5a190c7ef1f0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">化合价降低得电子，电子应从</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/38976580545a0405e4847dc13b4d221f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">指向</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3482b3e788f6069d41ee5a190c7ef1f0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选项箭头方向错误，应为</span><img  height=\"48\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/19/3b865566-1397-424c-81da-60dc6a594af7.png\" width=\"264\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">错误。</span></p></div></div>",
